title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/ddp_poster_11.jpeg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for newspapers and radio.
// todo: add bolstering the media stuff 

= Media

The liberal press are scattered across the nation, most of them are nominally independent, but are de facto controlled by our members. We could use these media for various purposes...

- @berlinertagblad
- @diehilfe
- @echoderjungedemokratie
- @partymedia
- @integrate1
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@berlinertagblad
title: Fund the Berliner Tageblatt
subtitle: -1 resource, the biggest left liberal publisher in Germany, edited by prominent DDP member, Theodor Wolff.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; new_middle_ddp += 6; old_middle_ddp += 4; rural_ddp += 3; workers_ddp += 4; unemployed_ddp += 3; catholic_ddp += 4; linksliberale_strenght += 4; pro_republic += 4; nationalism -= 3; socialism -= 3

We have funded Berliner Tageblatt, and with its wide circulation, we see a noticable increase in support for us and democracy.

@diehilfe
title: Fund Die Hilfe.
view-if: dh_integrated == 0
unavailable-subtitle: Die Hilfe has been integrated into our party's newspaper already, we would essentialy be throwing funds at nothing.
subtitle: -1 resource, edited by herr Fredrich Naumann himself.
on-arrival: if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 1 and linksliberale_strenght >= 25 workers_ddp += 6; if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 1 and linksliberale_strenght >= 25 linksliberale_strenght += 5; if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 0 and nationalliberale_strenght < 25 and linksliberale_strenght < 25 workers_ddp += 5; if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 0 and nationalliberale_strenght < 25 and linksliberale_strenght < 25 old_middle_ddp += 5; new_middle_ddp += 6; rural_ddp += 4; catholics_ddp += 5; unemployed_ddp += 4; if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 0 and nationalliberale_strenght >= 25 old_middle_ddp += 8; if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 0 and nationalliberale_strenght >= 25 nationalliberale_strenght+ += 5 

Funding Die Hilfe certainly benefits us, as the editors are our most loyal members. [? if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 1 and linksliberale_strenght >= 25 :  We see more of our grassroot members being attracted to the left-wing of our party, and our empowerment of them in the party has caused them to also take defacto control of the newspaper. ?] [? if yea_socialization_erkelenz == 0 and nationalliberale_strenght >= 25 : We see more of our grassroot members being aligned with the right wing of our party, as the empowerment of the more right-wing elements in the party has lead to Theodore Heuss taking de facto control of the newspaper. ?]

@echoderjungedemokratie
title: Fund the Echo der Junge Demokratie.
view-if: edjd_integrated == 0
unavailable-subtitle: Echo Der Junge Demokratie has been integrated into our party's newspaper already, we would essentialy be throwing funds at nothing.
subtitle: -1 resource, the newspaper of our Youth wing, herr Ludwig Quidde also publishes his writings here.
on-arrival: young_democrats += 1; pazifisten_strenght += 4; linksliberale_strenght += 4; new_middle_ddp += 6; old_middle_ddp += 5; pro-republic += 3; nationalism -= 3;

We have supported our youth wing's newspaper (wich is essentially suporting them), to which they have responded with enthusiasm. the pacifists have also became stronger because of this due to their link with the association.

@integrate1
title: Integrate Die Hilfe into our newspaper.
subtitle: -1 resources. We could integrate Die Hilfe into our existing newspaper network.
view-if: newspaper_founded == 1; newspaper_editor == "Theodor Heuss"
on-arrival: new_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; old_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; resources += 2;  

We have integrated Die Hilfe into our newspaper network,growing its influence significantly, and bringing with it funding and popularity.

@integrate3
title: We could integrate the Echo der Junge Demokratie and Die Hilfe into our newspaper network.


@partymedia
title: Perhaps we should create our official party media?
subtitle: -2 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: newspaper_founded == 0
on-arrival: newspaper_founded += 1; resources -= 2; 

We have founded our own newspaper, and we must now select its head editor.

- @heuss
- @quide
- @erkelenz

@heuss
title: Theodor Heuss, a rising star in the Sammlung with a patriotic attitute.
choose-if: nationalliberale_strenght and sammlung_strenght > pazifisten_strenght and pazifisten_strenght
unavailable-subtitle: The right and centre lacks the leverage to elevate Heuss to head editor.
on-arrival: newspaper_editor = "Theodor Heuss"; old_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; new_middle_campaign_modifier += 1; pro-republic += 4; nationalism += 4

We have chosen Heuss as the head editor, he is expected to steer the press to a more nationalist tone than our left liberals prefer, however his strong liberal stance quells any protests, at least for now.

@quide
title: Ludwig Quidde, head of the pacifist wing.
on-arrival: newspaper_editor = "Ludwig Quide"; anti_nationalism_modifier += 1; pro_republic_modifier += 1; 

The reknowned pacifist, Ludwig Quidde is chosen as head editor. He will make sure to criticize the ravaging nationalists on the far-right at all times and to promote pacifism amongst the German people.

@erkelenz
title: Anton Erkelenz, the labour leader.
choose-if: linksliberale_strength and pazifisten_strength > nationalliberale_strenght
unavailable-subtitle: The left lacks the political capital to elect Erkelenz.
on-arrival: newspaper_editor = "Anton Erkelenz"; workers_campaign_modifier += 1; pro_republic_modifier += 1; 

Surprisingly, Anton Erkelenz is elected head editor of our party newspaper. It seems we will be focusing more on the lower classes than the middle class to promote liberal democracy to the common people. 
